      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'm just finding it hard to explain to my stakeholders why these bugs feel so... random. like they aren't always reproducible every time we run the test, they just seem to pop up and vanish on their own. how can i describe that kind of unpredictable behavior in a way that doesn't make it sound like our code is just broken or unreliable?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
